Z||000010||Toddster||06-09-2001||01:21 PM||||Did you get the license number of the guy behind you too? He'd make a great witness. <BR>Frankly I'd go after the guy. If he is that obsessive compulsive about having his way he is eventually going to kill someone. You have a civic responsibility to get the freak show off the streets.<P>But that's me. I've never been one to shy away from confrontation when a moral imparitive is at issue. BRING IT THE F$%& ON!!||||reg||1
