Z||000012||fropuff||06-10-2001||10:59 AM||||I don't know if this will work, but if there's a scratch in there bad enough, tell them that the paint is a specially mixed, hard-to-copy metallic pearl.  Tell them that if you were to repaint just the one panel, it wouldn't match, so you need a repaint.  It might be insurance fraud or something like that, but the SOB could've killed your a$$.  It sounds stupid, but someday I hope I catch somebody keying my car, so I can get a new repaint.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  Good luck!!   <P>------------------<BR>Fuzz busters rock!||||reg||10
